   "id": "f0084c08",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Set OpenAI and Continuous Batching Configuration\n",
    "\n",
    "OpenAI Compatibility is enabled for the Wallaroo SGLang framework.  Updates to the OpenAI compatibility configuration and continuous batching configuration are set **post model upload** by updating the model configuration."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "6c44b591-6530-42cc-a352-ea06c5563ba5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Configuring as OpenAI\n",
    "\n",
    "continuous_batch_config = ContinuousBatchingConfig(max_concurrent_batch_size=1024)\n",
    "openai_config = OpenaiConfig(chat_completion_config={\"temperature\": .3, \"max_tokens\": 1024})\n",
    "model = model.configure(openai_config=openai_config, continuous_batching_config=continuous_batch_config)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4d6b4adf",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Deploy the Pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "With the model configuration options set, the model is deployed via a pipeline through these steps:\n",
    "\n",
    "* Set the Deployment Configuration.  This sets the resources allocated from the cluster for the pipeline for the model's exclusive use.\n",
    "  * In this example, the model is allocated 1 cpu, 12 G RAM, and 1 gpu.\n",
    "* Create the pipeline and set the model as a **pipeline step**.\n",
    "* Deploy the pipeline with the deployment configuration.\n",
    "\n",
    "Once deployment is complete, the pipeline is available for inference requests."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "03a4f9ba-1041-4a14-8045-5827529f1b0a",
